OL,3,ATurning cooler with wet and windy
OL,4,Aweather forecast for UK this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeteorological summer is over, schools
OL,7,Fare back and so is the UK's unsettled
OL,8,Fweather.
OL,10,FAfter a heat spike on Sunday, low
OL,11,Fpressure systems will continue to bring
OL,12,Fwet and windy conditions, especially to
OL,13,Fthe north of the UK at the beginning of
OL,14,Fthe week, before things settle down on
OL,15,FWednesday and Thursday.
OL,17,FIt will also feel cooler for many
OL,18,Fplaces across England and Wales, after
OL,19,FSunday's temperature approached 29C
OL,20,F(84F) in south-east England.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
