OL,3,ATurning cooler with wet and windy
OL,4,Aweather forecast for UK this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite a mostly dry weekend for many,
OL,7,Flast week was the wettest week in
OL,8,FEngland since early February, according
OL,9,Fto the Environment Agency.
